exports[`Quillfield Automation > Business System › 1. Foundation > tile segment-qf3n8d2w:value-proposition 1`] = `
"Value PropositionValue PropositioniValue PropositioniFor small New York professional-services firms that are drowning in repetitive admin, Quillfield Automation finds where AI and automation will save the most hours, builds those workflows on the tools the firm already uses, and keeps them running. A fixed-price audit comes first, so every build starts with a clear business case, and every automation is documented, privacy-reviewed and monitored. Quillfield stays accountable after launch, at a price and pace that suit a 10-person firm.Emotional NeedsConfidentProsperousOptimisticFrom the Profiles' NotesRelief from constant firefightingThe Busy Ops ManagerFeel in control of the agency's tools againThe Agency FounderSocial NeedsTrustedRespectedFrom the Profiles' NotesBe seen by the partners as the person who modernised the firmThe Busy Ops ManagerBe known by clients as an agency that uses AI wellThe Agency FounderOpen itemsiUnwanted benefit: AI Workflow Audit does Expertise and Safety / security best, which no Profile ticks as what matters most.Unwanted benefit: Automation Care Retainer does Safety / security best, which no Profile ticks as what matters most.Back‹›Back
[fields] For small New York professional-services firms that are drowning in repetitive admin, Quillfield Automation finds where AI and automation will save the most hours, builds those workflows on the tools the firm already uses, and keeps them running. A fixed-price audit comes first, so every build starts with a clear business case, and every automation is documented, privacy-reviewed and monitored. Quillfield stays accountable after launch, at a price and pace that suit a 10-person firm."
`;

