exports[`Quillfield Automation > Operations System › 3. Operational Log 1`] = `
"TilesQuillfield Automation…Saving…MenuWorkbook8. Operations System3. Operational LogQuestions• Generated automatically from the Process Library: leaving a Process Library edit adds one entryper changed Process, dated the day it was edited, cross-referencing that Process and its Owner.• The Description states only what actually changed -- updates, additions, or removals of aProcess's own fields, SOPs, or Steps.• Date, Process, Owner of Change, and Description can only be changed by editing the ProcessLibrary itself -- only the Notes column is written here.• Entries are always kept in chronological order, and can be filtered by Process or by Owner.Need Help?Filter by ProcessAll ProcessesFilter by OwnerAll OwnersLatest change per Process onlyNo changes logged yet -- editing a Process in Process Library and moving on will automatically add an entry here.‹PagesIntroduction1. Handbook2. Process Library3. Operational Log4. Roles & Responsibilities›Back
[fields] "
`;

exports[`Quillfield Automation > Operations System › 4. Roles & Responsibilities 1`] = `
